ed discovery of a mass grave  a staged drone strike against civilians  or a fake  even a real  attack using chemical weapons  russia has already claimed mass graves  exist in disputed pro-russian regions of  ukraine and putin is said to be  preparing a rare address to the russian  parliament the u.s says it believes any  russian action would target specific  groups and key sites within ukraine  including the capital kiev  all the while ukraine soldiers on  president vladimir zelinski toured the  front lines for a second straight day  walking a fine line staring down the  russian threat while trying not to get  dragged into a bloody conflict  jackson crosso global news washington  still ahead some frightening moments for  ferry passengers sailing in stormy  waters  in germany a fierce storm packing  hurricane-force winds caused extensive  damage and led to some scary moments  aboard a passenger ferry  wow the terrifying moment happened on a  river near hamburg water crashed right  through the windows as a wave washed  over the bow of the vessel  well with the looming threat of an  invasion in ukraine keeve has just  signed a new agreement with the uk and  poland the three countries will now  coordinate on cyber energy security and  countering disinformation poland's  involvement is key as nato looks to  bolster its eastern european flank in  case of wider fallout from russian  aggression our europe bureau chief  crystal gomezing is in poland tonight  with more crystal  jeff poland was named in russian demands  late last year for de-escalation around  ukraine it wanted to see multinational  nato forces leaving the country but  we've actually seen the opposite happen  nato is flexing its muscle showing  russia that it will not leave member  states vulnerable  it's business as usual on the streets of  southeastern poland but everyone knows  the concerns facing neighboring ukraine  this is quite a nervous situation in  ukraine and  she definitely was not to wear like  uk